 "intro_zh": "伊犁那拉提旅游风景区地处天山腹地，景区自南向北由高山草原观光区、哈萨克民俗风情区、旅游生活区组成，拥有夏牧场、柯孜拉霞瀑布、望天洞等著名景点。它以独特的自然景观、悠久的历史文化和浓郁的民族风情构成了独具特色的边塞风光。",
 "intro_en": "Ili Nalati Tourist Scenic Area is located in the hinterland of the Tianshan Mountains. From south to north, the scenic area consists of an alpine grassland tourist area, a Kazakh folk customs area, and a tourist life area. It has famous attractions such as Summer Ranch, Kezilashia Waterfall, and Wangtian Cave. It forms a unique frontier fortress scenery with its unique natural landscape, long history and culture and rich ethnic customs.",
